{
    "schema_version": "1.2",
    "name": "google-business-profile",
    "display_name": "Google Business Profile",
    "public_catalog": {
        "visibility": "public",
        "category": "analytics_product",
        "onboarding_modes": [
            "connector_pull"
        ],
        "verification": {
            "status": "blocked",
            "reason_code": "live_evidence_not_ratified",
            "follow_up": "Ratify once a real GBP account with granted quota (>0 QPM) exists (default 0-QPM access gate + no test account 2026-07-21)."
        }
    },
    "auth_type": "google_direct",
    "module_kind": "kpi",
    "report_profiles": [
        {
            "id": "location_daily",
            "display_name": "Location performance (daily)",
            "metrics": [
                "business_impressions_desktop_maps",
                "business_impressions_desktop_search",
                "business_impressions_mobile_maps",
                "business_impressions_mobile_search",
                "business_conversations",
                "business_direction_requests",
                "call_clicks",
                "website_clicks",
                "business_bookings",
                "business_food_orders",
                "business_food_menu_clicks"
            ],
            "dimensions": [
                "date",
                "location_id"
            ],
            "extraction_capabilities": {
                "row_limit": null,
                "filters_supported": true,
                "realtime": false
            },
            "extraction_path": "custom_pull",
            "_api_notes": "GET locations/{location}:fetchMultiDailyMetricsTimeSeries with all 11 DailyMetric values over the dailyRange, per selected location. Daily grain, all metrics ADDITIVE. History hard-capped at ~18 months; zero-days omitted by the API -> gap-filled to 0. Requires a granted (>0 QPM) project."
        },
        {
            "id": "social_post",
            "display_name": "Local posts (events)",
            "metrics": [],
            "dimensions": ["date"],
            "events": ["social_post"],
            "extraction_capabilities": {
                "row_limit": null,
                "filters_supported": false,
                "realtime": false
            },
            "extraction_path": "custom_pull",
            "landing": "context_events",
            "_api_notes": "GET https://mybusiness.googleapis.com/v4/{account}/{location}/localPosts (LEGACY v4 host, allowlist-gated) paginated via pageToken. createTime = event_date (YYYY-MM-DD); summary = label. account is resolved from the selected location's topology parent (discover_accounts). Reuses the existing business.manage scope. Persisted to context_events (no fact_daily_kpi). LIVE-DEFERRED: the v4 host is allowlist-restricted and GBP is 0-QPM by default (verification.status blocked). transform_events + fixtures prove the mapping; the live pull is ratified once the v4 host is granted."
        }
    ],
    "canonical_metric_mapping": {
        "BUSINESS_IMPRESSIONS_DESKTOP_MAPS": "business_impressions_desktop_maps",
        "BUSINESS_IMPRESSIONS_DESKTOP_SEARCH": "business_impressions_desktop_search",
        "BUSINESS_IMPRESSIONS_MOBILE_MAPS": "business_impressions_mobile_maps",
        "BUSINESS_IMPRESSIONS_MOBILE_SEARCH": "business_impressions_mobile_search",
        "BUSINESS_CONVERSATIONS": "business_conversations",
        "BUSINESS_DIRECTION_REQUESTS": "business_direction_requests",
        "CALL_CLICKS": "call_clicks",
        "WEBSITE_CLICKS": "website_clicks",
        "BUSINESS_BOOKINGS": "business_bookings",
        "BUSINESS_FOOD_ORDERS": "business_food_orders",
        "BUSINESS_FOOD_MENU_CLICKS": "business_food_menu_clicks"
    },
    "canonical_event_mapping": {
        "social_post": "social_post"
    },
    "canonical_dimension_mapping": {},
    "error_map": {
        "400": "invalid_request",
        "401": "auth_expired",
        "403": "permission_denied",
        "404": "permission_denied",
        "429": "provider_transient",
        "500": "provider_transient"
    },
    "_error_map_note": "VERIFIE le 2026-07-21. GBP APIs return the standard Google API error envelope { error: { code, message, status, errors[]:{message, domain, reason}, details } }. No GBP-specific numeric subcodes, so the map is keyed on HTTP STATUS alone: 401->auth_expired, 403->permission_denied (most commonly quota=0 / not-allowlisted, or missing location role), 404->permission_denied, 400->invalid_request, 5xx->provider_transient. 429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED (quota) raises core.quota.RateLimitError (breaker path). IMPORTANT provisioning caveat (not an error-map concern): a newly-enabled project has 0 QPM until Google approves an access request -> every call 403s until then; the v4 Reviews host is additionally allowlist-gated.",
    "account_topology": {
        "_comment": "Two-level GBP hierarchy across two APIs. Account Management accounts.list -> accounts/{account_id} (AccountType PERSONAL/LOCATION_GROUP/USER_GROUP/ORGANIZATION). Business Information accounts.locations.list -> locations/{location_id} = the REPORTING ENTITY (the Performance and Reviews endpoints are scoped by this id). One token can access multiple accounts and their locations. discover_accounts enumerates account->location and returns the reachable locations. Access-check = fetchMultiDailyMetricsTimeSeries returns 200 for a selected location. No *_LOCATION_ID env var (doctrine); the selected location lives in connection_ref.",
        "levels": [
            {
                "id": "account",
                "label": "Account"
            },
            {
                "id": "location",
                "label": "Location"
            }
        ],
        "selection_level": "location",
        "discovery": {
            "callable": "discover_accounts"
        }
    },
    "quota": {
        "window_seconds": 60,
        "budget_points": 300,
        "read_cost": 1,
        "write_cost": 1,
        "_rate_limit_note": "VERIFIE le 2026-07-21 (https://developers.google.com/my-business/content/limits): DEFAULT 0 QPM (project un-runnable until Google approves an access/quota request -- no sandbox); approved default 300 QPM across Performance/BusinessInformation/AccountManagement. Budget = 300 points / 60s (the approved ceiling). fetchMultiDailyMetricsTimeSeries batches all 11 metrics in ONE call per location per range. 429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED -> RateLimitError."
    },
    "widget_ref": "ui://core/daily-report",
